From f0ef08d7b4a6639fb657dfe0ab15436d2730bf7a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Basin Battle <basin@battle>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 00:42:21 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Ability markers: aim shapes, strips, shapes at a spot, a
 friend's colour

The eighth round of the action-combat calls. SetAimMarker also lays a
strip (a projectile's path), a cone or a ring round the hero along the
view; SetTelegraph takes a strip shape (with its width) and a friendly
kind (blue); SetTelegraphAt lays a shape on the ground at a spot facing a
way (a sky-fall's ring, a strip). HasActionCombat is 8.
